<title>RUSSIA: Russian May unemployment steady at 9.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian May unemployment steady at 9.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Russia was seven million, or 9.6 percent of the workforce, at the end of May, the same as a month earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 MAY 97     APR 97     MAY 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed (million)	6.97	 6.99	 6.60</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	9.6	  9.6	  N/A</p>
<p>    officially registered (million)  2.49	 2.52	 2.69</p>
<p>NOTES - Figures for total unemployed are based on the methodology of the International Labour Organisation.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
